# kiwi.manifest — app metadata for the kiwi updater
NAME=ensconce
DESCRIPTION=Modular post-installation setup for Bluefin-DX — packages, Flatpaks, extensions, Nextcloud, dconf and login screen from plain list files, with --export to clone a machine's setup
